<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/22/eng@/~part_II__cl_14__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "A picture of the child witness or any other person, place or thing which may lead to the identification of the child witness in the proceedings mentioned in subsection (1) shall not be published in any mass-media or transmit through any electronic medium."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/22/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/22/eng@/~part_II__cl_14__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/22/eng@/~part_II__cl_14> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/22/eng@> .
