<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/22/eng@/~part_II__cl_14__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Any person who contravenes subsection (1) or (2) commits an offence and shall on conviction be liable to a fine not exceeding ten thousand ringgit or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding five years or to both."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/22/eng@> .
